@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> Registration : [Citizen]
UserType --> Login : [Registered Citizen]

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details
Registration : if invalid -> end
Registration : save user details after success
Registration : allow login

state Login
Login : entry / Get username and password
Login : continue if successful
Login : provide multiple attempts if incorrect

state Citizen
Citizen : login allowed
Citizen : upload documents
Citizen : view profile
Citizen : apply for certificate
Citizen : reapply after sending request to issuer
Citizen : continue uploading documents if needed
Citizen : logout after actions done

@enduml
